   "source": [
    "# 🧠🤖 第三周-Day4：DPO与其他对齐方法对比\n",
    "\n",
    "今天我们要深入了解大模型对齐技术的演进历程，从复杂的RLHF到简洁的DPO，看看研究者们是如何一步步优化对齐方法的！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🔄 昨日复习：RLHF核心要点\n",
    "\n",
    "• **三步走流程**：SFT→RM→PPO，循序渐进提升模型对齐能力\n",
    "• **奖励模型训练**：学习人类偏好，将主观判断转化为量化奖励\n",
    "• **PPO优化**：用强化学习让模型学习最大化人类奖励的策略\n",
    "• **核心优势**：能够持续改进模型，适应人类偏好变化"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📚 今日主题：DPO与其他对齐方法对比\n",
    "\n",
    "今天我们要学习的是大模型对齐技术的一次重大革新——DPO（直接偏好优化）！它将原来复杂的RLHF流程简化为一步，让对齐训练变得像SFT一样简单。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 📝 核心知识点：\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 1. **RLHF的痛点** 🤯\n",
    "- 需要训练单独的奖励模型（RM）\n",
    "- PPO强化学习循环复杂且不稳定\n",
    "- 计算资源消耗大，训练周期长\n",
    "- 超参数调优困难\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 2. **DPO的革命性简化** ✨\n",
    "- **数学发现**：DPO证明了可以直接用分类损失替代复杂的RL流程\n",
    "- **一步到位**：直接优化偏好数据，跳过RM和PPO\n",
    "- **计算高效**：像SFT一样简单，但效果媲美RLHF\n",
    "- **稳定性好**：避免了RL训练的不稳定性\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 3. **DPO的核心数学原理** 🧮\n",
    "- 将偏好对齐问题转化为分类问题\n",
    "- 直接通过比较两个响应的优劣来调整模型参数\n",
    "- 最大化好响应的概率，最小化坏响应的概率\n",
    "- 自动隐式学习奖励函数\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 4. **DPO vs RLHF对比表** 📊\n",
    "| 特点 | RLHF | DPO |\n",
    "|------|------|-----|\n",
    "| 训练步骤 | 3步（SFT+RM+PPO） | 1步（直接偏好优化） |\n",
    "| 计算复杂度 | 高 | 低 |\n",
    "| 训练稳定性 | 较差 | 优秀 |\n",
    "| 数据需求 | 偏好对 + 单条数据 | 只需要偏好对 |\n",
    "| 超参数数量 | 多 | 少 |\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 5. **其他对齐方法概览** 🔄\n",
    "- **KTO**：保持模型原始能力的同时进行对齐\n",
    "- **GRPO**：群体偏好优化，适合分布式训练\n",
    "- **CDPO**：对比DPO，支持多轮对话偏好\n",
    "- **IPO**：内在偏好优化，强调模型自身一致性\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 6. **方法选择指南** 🎯\n",
    "- **新项目推荐**：DPO（简单高效）\n",
    "- **需要保持原能力**：KTO\n",
    "- **大规模分布式**：GRPO\n",
    "- **复杂对话场景**：CDPO\n",
    "- **研究探索**：各种方法的变体"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from typing import List, Tuple\n",
    "\n",
    "# 设置中文字体\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif'] = ['SimHei', 'Arial Unicode MS']\n",
    "plt.rcParams['axes.unicode_minus'] = False"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 可视化DPO和RLHF的训练复杂度对比\n",
    "methods = ['RLHF', 'DPO', 'KTO', 'GRPO']\n",
    "training_steps = [3, 1, 1, 2]  # RLHF需要3步，DPO等只需要1-2步\n",
    "complexity_scores = [8, 2, 3, 4]  # 主观复杂度评分\n",
    "stability_scores = [6, 9, 8, 7]  # 稳定性评分（满分10）\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, (ax1, ax2, ax3) = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(15, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 训练步骤对比\n",
    "ax1.bar(methods, training_steps, color=['#FF6B6B', '#4ECDC4', '#45B7D1', '#96CEB4'])\n",
    "ax1.set_title('训练步骤数量对比')\n",
    "ax1.set_ylabel('步骤数量')\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(training_steps):\n",
    "    ax1.text(i, v + 0.1, str(v), ha='center')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 复杂度对比\n",
    "ax2.bar(methods, complexity_scores, color=['#FF6B6B', '#4ECDC4', '#45B7D1', '#96CEB4'])\n",
    "ax2.set_title('实现复杂度对比（1-10分）')\n",
    "ax2.set_ylabel('复杂度分数')\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(complexity_scores):\n",
    "    ax2.text(i, v + 0.1, str(v), ha='center')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 稳定性对比\n",
    "ax3.bar(methods, stability_scores, color=['#FF6B6B', '#4ECDC4', '#45B7D1', '#96CEB4'])\n",
    "ax3.set_title('训练稳定性对比（1-10分）')\n",
    "ax3.set_ylabel('稳定性分数')\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(stability_scores):\n",
    "    ax3.text(i, v + 0.1, str(v), ha='center')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 模拟DPO的偏好优化过程\n",
    "def dpo_preference_optimization(preferred_logits, rejected_logits, beta=0.1):\n",
    \"\"\"\n",
    "    DPO偏好优化的核心计算\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # 计算log概率比\n",
    "    log_ratio = preferred_logits - rejected_logits\n",
    "    # DPO损失函数\n",
    "    loss = -np.logsigmoid(beta * log_ratio)\n",
    "    return loss\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模拟偏好数据\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "num_pairs = 100\n",
    "preferred_logits = np.random.normal(2.0, 0.5, num_pairs)  # 好响应的logits\n",
    "rejected_logits = np.random.normal(0.0, 0.5, num_pairs)   # 坏响应的logits\n",
    "\n",
    "# 计算DPO损失\n",
    "losses = dpo_preference_optimization(preferred_logits, rejected_logits)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化优化过程\n",
    "fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 偏好分布\n",
    "ax1.hist(preferred_logits, alpha=0.7, label='优选响应', bins=20, color='green')\n",
    "ax1.hist(rejected_logits, alpha=0.7, label='淘汰响应', bins=20, color='red')\n",
    "ax1.set_title('DPO偏好分布')\n",
    "ax1.set_xlabel('Logits值')\n",
    "ax1.set_ylabel('频次')\n",
    "ax1.legend()\n",
    "ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 损失函数可视化\n",
    "beta_values = np.linspace(0.01, 1.0, 100)\n",
    "avg_losses = []\n",
    "for beta in beta_values:\n",
    "    losses = dpo_preference_optimization(preferred_logits, rejected_logits, beta)\n",
    "    avg_losses.append(np.mean(losses))\n",
    "\n",
    "ax2.plot(beta_values, avg_losses, 'b-', linewidth=2)\n",
    "ax2.set_title('DPO损失随β参数变化')\n",
    "ax2.set_xlabel('β参数（正则化强度）')\n",
    "ax2.set_ylabel('平均损失')\n",
    "ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"平均DPO损失: {np.mean(losses):.3f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"最大损失: {np.max(losses):.3f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"最小损失: {np.min(losses):.3f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 不同对齐方法的效果对比模拟\n",
    "alignment_methods = ['SFT', 'RLHF', 'DPO', 'KTO', 'GRPO']\n",
    "alignment_scores = [0.6, 0.85, 0.82, 0.78, 0.80]  # 对齐效果评分\n",
    "compute_efficiency = [0.9, 0.4, 0.8, 0.7, 0.6]   # 计算效率评分\n",
    "data_efficiency = [0.7, 0.5, 0.8, 0.75, 0.65]    # 数据效率评分\n",
    "\n",
    "# 雷达图展示多维对比\n",
    "angles = np.linspace(0, 2 * np.pi, len(alignment_methods), endpoint=False)\n",
    "angles = np.concatenate((angles, [angles[0]]))\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 8), subplot_kw=dict(projection='polar'))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 绘制各方法的雷达图\n",
    "for i, method in enumerate(alignment_methods):\n",
    "    scores = [alignment_scores[i], compute_efficiency[i], data_efficiency[i]]\n",
    "    scores = scores + [scores[0]]  # 闭合图形\n",
    "    angle_slice = angles[i:i+2]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ax.plot(angle_slice, scores, 'o-', linewidth=2, label=method)\n",
    "    ax.fill(angle_slice, scores, alpha=0.1)\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_xticks(angles[:-1])\n",
    "ax.set_xticklabels(['对齐效果', '计算效率', '数据效率'])\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 1)\n",
    "ax.set_title('不同对齐方法多维效果对比', y=1.1)\n",
    "ax.legend(loc='upper right', bbox_to_anchor=(1.3, 1.0))\n",
    "ax.grid(True)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 实际使用中的选择建议\n",
    "def alignment_method_selector(use_case):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    根据不同使用场景推荐对齐方法\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    recommendations = {\n",
    "        '新项目快速开发': 'DPO - 简单高效，效果优秀',\n",
    "        '大规模分布式训练': 'GRPO - 支持群体偏好优化',\n",
    "        '需要保持原能力': 'KTO - 在对齐的同时保留原始能力',\n",
    "        '复杂多轮对话': 'CDPO - 专门针对多轮对话优化',\n",
    "        '研究探索': '多种方法对比实验',\n",
    "        '资源受限': 'DPO - 计算需求最小'\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    return recommendations.get(use_case, 'DPO - 通用推荐')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 打印不同场景的建议\n",
    "print(\"🎯 对齐方法选择指南：\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*50)\n",
    "for scenario, recommendation in alignment_method_selector.__doc__.split('\\n')[1:-1]:\n",
    "    if scenario.strip():\n",
    "        clean_scenario = scenario.strip('\"\\' ')\n",
    "        if clean_scenario in alignment_method_selector.__dict__:\n",
    "            print(f\"📌 {clean_scenario}: {alignment_method_selector(clean_scenario)}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n💡 实际应用建议：\")\n",
    "print(\"1. 初学者建议从DPO开始，理解基本原理\")\n",
    "print(\"2. 有资源可以进行多种方法对比\")\n",
    "print(\"3. 根据具体任务需求选择合适方法\")\n",
    "print(\"4. 注意数据质量和数量是关键\")"
   ]
  },
